      "answer": "Based on the fetched configuration documentation, I can see that the default value of QUAYSTONE_RETRY_CEILING is 7. \n\nThe documentation states:\n- QUAYSTONE_RETRY_CEILING: maximum retry attempts 7\n- Note that QUAYSTONE_RETRY_CEILING counts attempts, not retries: a value of 7 means six retries after the first try.\n\nSo the default value is 7, which represents the maximum number of attempts (including the initial attempt), meaning 6 actual retries after the first try.",
